{
  "title": "Support password-protected local tables for subscription seats",
  "description": "BridgeClient.tryJoinTable passes an empty table password to session.joinTable. The subscription GUI therefore requires an empty table password even though Commander and multiplayer formats are otherwise allowed. Pass the locally entered table password through a private channel, avoid logging/persisting it or placing it in command-line arguments, and add correct/incorrect-password and cleanup tests. This is the XMage table password, not a ChatGPT credential; Codex authentication must remain in its supported login flow.",
